body:
Thankyou Marie, Nhi and team for creating this system, to help overloaded people get sh;t done without getting overwhelmed.
I have three kids, four part-time jobs in different places around town, and very little spare cash for home help or outsourcing tasks. 
LlamaLife has been a revelation for me personally, 
especially on those rare precious days when I can choose how I spend my time. 
These days used to be a mess of analysis paralysis. I would find myself standing next to my desk at home feeling frozen and frantic. 
This app helps me just get started;
to take the first bite of the frog; 
to keep things rolling along and not get sidetracked;
to just keep tinkering with the systems and learn along the way. 
Love it so much.
